      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.58,
          "end": 5.01,
          "en": "-: In the last lecture we had a look at event binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.01,
          "end": 7.35,
          "en": "Now before focusing on two-way binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.35,
          "end": 9.09,
          "en": "and explaining what this is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.09,
          "end": 10.98,
          "en": "there's one other important thing you need to know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.98,
          "end": 12.6,
          "en": "about event binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.6,
          "end": 16.05,
          "en": "Let's say before this button we also have a label",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.05,
          "end": 17.13,
          "en": "server name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.13,
          "end": 18.21,
          "en": "And then more importantly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.21,
          "end": 22.02,
          "en": "we have a input which we maybe give a bootstrap class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.02,
          "end": 23.58,
          "en": "of foreign control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.58,
          "end": 26.16,
          "en": "Here, I want to allow the user to enter the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.16,
          "end": 29.22,
          "en": "of the server, which should get created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 29.22,
          "end": 31.23,
          "en": "So here we could listen to the input event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.23,
          "end": 34.17,
          "en": "This is a normal DOM event provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.17,
          "end": 37.86,
          "en": "by the input element which is far than ever the user types.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 37.86,
          "end": 42.18,
          "en": "And here we could execute on update server name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.18,
          "end": 45.12,
          "en": "because it will be fired on every keystroke.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.12,
          "end": 48.57,
          "en": "So let's add this method to our component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.57,
          "end": 52.74,
          "en": "And now I somehow want to output what the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.74,
          "end": 56.067,
          "en": "entered right now, what the value of this field is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.067,
          "end": 57.84,
          "en": "Now we can do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.84,
          "end": 60.81,
          "en": "by passing dollar sign event here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.81,
          "end": 63.45,
          "en": "And dollar sign event, super important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.45,
          "end": 66.69,
          "en": "is kind of a reserved variable name you can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.69,
          "end": 69.96000000000001,
          "en": "in the template when using event binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.96000000000001,
          "end": 70.98,
          "en": "For this event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.98,
          "end": 73.98,
          "en": "So only between these quotation marks here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.98,
          "end": 78.3,
          "en": "dollar sign event will simply be the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.3,
          "end": 80.43,
          "en": "emitted with that event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.43,
          "end": 82.92,
          "en": "So input and click are default events provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.92,
          "end": 85.11,
          "en": "by the dom you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 85.11,
          "end": 87.87,
          "en": "And they ship us some data when they are fired.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.87,
          "end": 89.49,
          "en": "The click event gives us an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.49,
          "end": 92.31,
          "en": "which for example holds the coordinates where we clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.31,
          "end": 94.44,
          "en": "And the input event also gives us some data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 94.44,
          "end": 96.45,
          "en": "some information about the event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 96.45,
          "end": 100.11,
          "en": "Now we can capture this data with dollar sign event passed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.11,
          "end": 103.05,
          "en": "as an argument to the method we're calling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.05,
          "end": 105.87,
          "en": "or used anywhere between these quotation marks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.87,
          "end": 107.46000000000001,
          "en": "in the code we're executing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 107.46000000000001,
          "end": 109.68,
          "en": "Dollar sign event, something to keep in mind.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 109.68,
          "end": 113.22,
          "en": "Reserve the word which gives us access to the event data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 113.22,
          "end": 116.52000000000001,
          "en": "So now we pass this to on update server name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 116.52000000000001,
          "end": 119.52000000000001,
          "en": "So here we know we will receive this event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 119.52000000000001,
          "end": 122.34,
          "en": "and this will be of type any for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 122.34,
          "end": 125.61,
          "en": "So now let's simply log it to the console",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 125.61,
          "end": 128.133,
          "en": "so that we can see it in this debug log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 129.06,
          "end": 130.33,
          "en": "If we do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 131.58,
          "end": 133.35,
          "en": "and I now type something here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 133.35,
          "end": 135.123,
          "en": "watch the console on the right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 136.2,
          "end": 138.18,
          "en": "A couple of outputs were written there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 138.18,
          "end": 139.53,
          "en": "Four to be precise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 139.53,
          "end": 142.77,
          "en": "because I typed four characters did four keystrokes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 142.77,
          "end": 145.53,
          "en": "So the input event was fired four times.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 145.53,
          "end": 147.15,
          "en": "And if we have a look at this event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 147.15,
          "end": 149.1,
          "en": "we've got a couple of information here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 149.1,
          "end": 151.82999999999998,
          "en": "For example, the target.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 151.82999999999998,
          "end": 154.74,
          "en": "And the target simply is the HTML element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 154.74,
          "end": 156.39,
          "en": "on which this event occurred.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 156.39,
          "end": 159.81,
          "en": "So here on the target, since this is an input element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 159.81,
          "end": 161.523,
          "en": "if we scroll down,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 162.6,
          "end": 165.22,
          "en": "we also got",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 166.53,
          "end": 168.21,
          "en": "the value test",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 168.21,
          "end": 169.92000000000002,
          "en": "and this is what the user entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 169.92000000000002,
          "end": 171.57,
          "en": "So what we can do now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 171.57,
          "end": 176.31,
          "en": "in our TypeScript code is we can set a server name property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 176.31,
          "end": 178.8,
          "en": "which is an empty string by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 178.8,
          "end": 181.53,
          "en": "-: And then here in on update server name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 181.53,
          "end": 185.79,
          "en": "Instead of logging it, we could say this server name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 185.79,
          "end": 188.1,
          "en": "And we just learned that on the event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 188.1,
          "end": 191.13,
          "en": "which is of type event, as we now also saw",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 191.13,
          "end": 194.16,
          "en": "here, we have a target.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 194.16,
          "end": 196.743,
          "en": "And on the target we have a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 197.57999999999998,
          "end": 198.93,
          "en": "Now this is only available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 198.93,
          "end": 203.01,
          "en": "because the target is off type input element though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 203.01,
          "end": 205.17000000000002,
          "en": "This is why my ID doesn't like it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 205.17000000000002,
          "end": 208.41,
          "en": "We can't explicitly inform it about the type in type script",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 208.41,
          "end": 211.15,
          "en": "by adding HTML input element here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 212.57999999999998,
          "end": 215.4,
          "en": "in front of it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 215.4,
          "end": 219.81,
          "en": "And again this is just needed to inform type script",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 219.81,
          "end": 222.87,
          "en": "that we know that the type of the HTML element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 222.87,
          "end": 225.66,
          "en": "of this event will be an HTML input element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 225.66,
          "end": 228.75,
          "en": "We do this explicit casting with this syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 228.75,
          "end": 232.14,
          "en": "with the opening and closing tag with the smaller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 232.14,
          "end": 235.23,
          "en": "and greater than sign and to type in between.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 235.23,
          "end": 239.28,
          "en": "So with that, we assign this value to our server name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 239.28,
          "end": 243.153,
          "en": "What we can now do is in the HTML file here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 243.99,
          "end": 245.55,
          "en": "We can output this for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 245.55,
          "end": 247.47,
          "en": "So with string interpolation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 247.47,
          "end": 251.19,
          "en": "we could output the server name below the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 251.19,
          "end": 252.6,
          "en": "If we save this and go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 252.6,
          "end": 256.53,
          "en": "to this application and I type test server here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 256.53,
          "end": 260.43,
          "en": "you see this dynamically, updates below the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 260.43,
          "end": 264.39,
          "en": "This is how you can use this dollar sign event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 264.39,
          "end": 267.39,
          "en": "object to fetch the event data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 267.39,
          "end": 268.29,
          "en": "Now with that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
